<h3>February 2009</h3>

<h4>Only Time Flies</h4>
<Image src={elNpt} alt="Enya" style="float:left;margin:.5em 1em 1em 0;"  width="150" height="150" />

<p><strong class="date">February 16 2009 —</strong> "My! My! Time Flies!" is th third single from <em>And Winter Came...</em>, released only digitally with no additional b-sides on February 2nd. The track is being promoted by Enya on a couple of TV shows, including the RTÉ's <a href="http://www.rte.ie/tv/latelate/av_20090206.html?2488936,null,228">Late Late Show</a> (Dublin, February 6). She was joined by the lead guitarist for "My! My! Time Flies!", Pat O�Farrell.</p>

<p>Enya also appered recently in <a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?gl=IT&hl=it&v=VfhgMfJqxbU">Willkommen bei Carmen Nebel</a> (Salzburg, January 31) and <a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?gl=IT&hl=it&v=n8qVCQg9Nm8">The Alan Titchmarsch Show</a> (London, February 3).</p>

<p>Two new pictures from <em>And Winter Came...</em> phososhoot were released in Enya official forum, Unity: <a href="http://lh5.ggpht.com/_CxhYcIpnE6M/SZBE4fGPdNI/AAAAAAAACQ0/ozj5FlvjulA/s1600-h/enya_no_1_resize%5B7%5D.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">image 1</a>, <a href="http://lh3.ggpht.com/_CxhYcIpnE6M/SZBE6oaIVlI/AAAAAAAACQ8/vZOkhvtHngw/s1600-h/_resize%5B6%5D.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">image 2</a>.</p>

