<p>The single should be released for download in February 2nd.</p>

<h4>Enya performing in Japan</h4>

<p><strong class="date">January 3 2009 —</strong> Enya performed "Orinoco Flow" and "Dreams are More Precious" in Ireland  to broadcast via satellite for the Japanese show, Kohaku, Wednesday. <a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n6_1yAOXAj8">See the video here</a>. There's also an interview before the performance. She also made an <a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TcTFjFRUN9c">incredible performance of "Orinoco Flow" and "Trains and Winter Rains"</a> for the Japanese NTV Christmas Show</p>

<p>Her <a href="http://abcnews.go.com/Video/playerIndex?id=6507880">appearance in Good Morning America</a> in December can be see in the show's site. Also, a <a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B7hDkjb1m_0">video form the Berlin Staatsballet performance</a> in the <em>And Winter Came...</em> German launch party  is now online.</p>

