<h4>Clannad touring the UK</h4>
<p><strong class="date">March 14 2008 —</strong> <a href="/enya-clannad/">Clannad</a>, the Irish band formed by many Enya relatives, it's in a comeback tour in the UK. It is 25 years since their "Theme From Harry�s Game" became a hit in Europe.</p>
<p>"It�s been a long time but I still crave the stage," says guitarist and vocalist Noel Duggan, now in his 60th year. His niece, the solo performer Enya, spent two years working with Clannad. "She was a very shy little girl. We don't see much of Enya at all now. She lives in a castle at Killiney, she lives like a queen. She doesn't go anywhere; she is a recluse."</p>
<p>The 2008 11-date UK tour will end at the Philharmonic Hall in Liverpool on March 14.</p>
